WEBVTT

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:34.080
(Applause)

00:05:34.163 --> 00:05:35.623
So I didn't let that stop me.

00:05:35.664 --> 00:05:39.126
I went out there
and built a great business.

00:05:39.168 --> 00:05:41.128
And here are a few points.

00:05:41.796 --> 00:05:45.716
Since inception, we've doubled
revenue year on year.

00:05:46.092 --> 00:05:50.346
(Applause)

00:05:50.513 --> 00:05:53.849
We’ve built technology
that can predict oxygen demand,

00:05:53.891 --> 00:05:58.229
and we use blockchain
to track our blood system.

00:05:58.229 --> 00:06:01.982
These innovations are novel
even by global standards.